<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ceremonyContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The ritual process in which this entity — sign, rhythm, plant use, or artifact — is employed. Range: travay:RitualProcess."@en .
