<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#documentsSpecimen> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a DocumentaryEvidence record to a SacredSpecimen it documents. A photograph, manuscript, or archival record may document one or more sacred objects. The existence of documentation is public-unrestricted; the ritual details of the object are governed by iroko:sacredStatus on the SacredSpecimen instance."@en .
